    <data key="d0">FanFight Architecture for Daily Fantasy Sports Platform</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3WgTBTDlQN8</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture supports over 1.5M registered users with peak loads during sports matches like cricket and football.</data>
